OL,3,GNEWSAPeople told to keep windows and
OL,4,Adoors shut over 'hazardous gas'
OL,5,Aincident
OL,6,
OL,7,FPeople in County Down have been advised
OL,8,Fto keep their windows and doors closed
OL,9,Fover what the police have described as
OL,10,Fa suspected chemical leak.
OL,12,FThree fire appliances are at the scene
OL,13,Fon the Steps Road in Magheralin.
OL,15,FThe Northern Ireland Fire and Rescue
OL,16,FService (NIFRS) said it was dealing
OL,17,Fwith a "hazardous incident involving
OL,18,Fgas" and advised people to avoid the
OL,19,Farea.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
